            "description": "<div class=\"article-body\">\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">日股連續兩日反彈，但仍受制於六萬關口。日經平均指數收報59,444點，升419點或0.71%。</p>\n</div>",
